    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), except in battle rounds 1 and 2, on a **T’AU EMPIRE** unit of yours not yet picked to shoot this phase.\n\nOn this Stratagem's first use, also pick an [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) outside the opponent's deployment zone; it is your Trap objective marker for the rest of the battle.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, the chosen unit's models get +1 to [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) for ranged attacks against an enemy unit in range of the Trap objective marker.",
